ith the fields' names."] [1554 1 "// asyncgenHooks are each thread's async generator hooks (firstiter, finalizer; nil unset, None too), as the thread"] [1555 1 "// state's async_gen_firstiter and async_gen_finalizer: firstiter called on an async generator's first __anext__, asend,"] [1556 1 "// athrow or aclose (coro.go's asyncGenInitHooks; asyncio's tracking of unfinished async generators for"] [1557 1 "// shutdown_asyncgens); the finalizer kept, never called (pyi has no finalization, PY7)."] [1562 1 "// stdlibAdded315 and stdlibRemoved315 are 3.15.2's Python/stdlib_module_names.h against 3.14.10's (queue 252): its"] [1563 1 "// 296 names."] [1568 1 "// stdlibModuleNames is sys.stdlib_module_names (Python/stdlib_module_names.h of CPython 3.14.10, its 297 names; queue 223:"] [1569 1 "// traceback's \"Did you forget to import\" reads it)"] [1605 1 "// utf8Mode315 is 3.15's UTF-8 mode (PEP 686, Python/initconfig.c's config_init_utf8_mode; queue 237): on by default,"] [1606 1 "// -X utf8=0 (or PYTHONUTF8=0, which -E and -I ignore) turns it off, -X utf8 and -X utf8=1 on. 3.14's answer stays"] [1607 1 "// pyi's 1 (the locale's coercion pyi does not model)."] [1621 1 "// utf8Mode314 is 3.14's UTF-8 mode (PEP 540, Python/preconfig.c's preconfig_init_utf8_mode; queue 553): -X utf8[=0|1],"] [1622 1 "// else PYTHONUTF8 (0 or 1; -E and -I ignore it), else on only when LC_CTYPE's locale (LC_ALL, LC_CTYPE, LANG, musl's"] [1623 1 "// default C.UTF-8) is the C or POSIX locale. Under C.UTF-8 the standard streams' errors stay surrogateescape (a locale"] [1624 1 "// coercion target's, config_get_stdio_errors), so only open()'s and TextIOWrapper's default encoding (the locale's) and"] [1625 1 "// sys.flags change."] [1645 1 "// utf8ModeOn is the running version's UTF-8 mode (sys.flags.utf8_mode's): 3.15's, else 3.14's rule (py-regress-1126:"] [1646 1 "// open()'s and TextIOWrapper's default encoding under it, _Py_GetLocaleEncodingObject's \"utf-8\" only in UTF-8 mode, else"] [1647 1 "